    "detailed_description": "<h1>OPEN PLAYTEST during the STEAM WARGAMES FEST - APRIL 28 to MAY 5th</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/6b0372d71e30866fd711f9008b48373b.avif?t=1745889879\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To celebrate the Steam WARGAMES FEST, we are reopening our test server from April 28 to May 5th so every wargame lover can try <i>Aeon Wars Tactics</i>, our upcoming turn-based tactical wargame inspired by tabletop miniature wargames.<br><br>Tons of new features!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now with a Single PvE mode, new units, new weapons, gears, and abilities, a new skirmish map, and more! Come and see what's changed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Give feedback and help us shape the future of the game!<br><br>Register now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/4eba4a0a42c7ea9ae9086c1970f8995c.poster.avif?t=1745889879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/4eba4a0a42c7ea9ae9086c1970f8995c.webm?t=1745889879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/4eba4a0a42c7ea9ae9086c1970f8995c.mp4?t=1745889879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Aeon Wars Tactics is a multiplayer turn-based strategy, tactical wargame. Featuring true digital miniatures, it is set in an original sci-fi universe where you battle with your friends in epic diorama-style terrains. Collect, build, and customize your army. Engage with your friends in large-scale battles and deadly skirmishes. Deploy powerful mechs, special units, and unique characters to save humanity or end its dominance on Leng. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/5edf763d4f9e49393e62fd77e389ee1b.avif?t=1745889879\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/5ffb6e8e7aaf1f36c8794ad9fae83fee.avif?t=1745889879\" /></div>Wargaming without real-world limits. Aeon Wars brings fully animated handcrafted miniatures, immersive maps with epic diorama-style terrains, and a frictionless hobby experience. Your miniatures have never looked so cool! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/31e7efe08ab8278c1446057c9f2483ce.avif?t=1745889879\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/b4c4facdb1e9db54f34f22a36ecafa12.webp?t=1745889879\" /></div>From the smallest detail on your model to an entire map, everything is customizable in Aeon Wars. Access professional tools to mod, paint, and personalize your model to your wildest dreams. Change the cosmetics, weapon loadouts, and accessories of your troops to your taste and playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/c20b31690dc3d8dbcfa225a1011cb02a.avif?t=1745889879\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/Steam_page_header_your_army_SteamRez_v2.png?t=1745889879\" /></div>Assemble your squads to build the perfect roosters for the maps and scenarios you want to play and the strategies you're aiming for. Bring your troops to battle, tweak your loadouts, and improve your army until you crush all your enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/d236d4cc99704ee8ca5205acdcaf89a0.avif?t=1745889879\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/ea1d273c8915c3815b99e2d74173d861.avif?t=1745889879\" /></div>Aeon Wars is all about tactical choices. Strategically position your troops on the battlefield, take advantage of covers, run to capture critical objectives and use each of your units unique abilities to secure victory! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/e2a9adc5c035a7a3889e813e5644c893.avif?t=1745889879\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/82ab324af477d4b52367daa448420fe6.webp?t=1745889879\" /></div>Decide which faction shall rule and impose its dominion on Leng. Each one has its radically unique flavor and gameplay style. Choose your favorite or try them all to experience the wide variety of models and abilities available.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/48ba0fb701fe07aa919c560c0b41282e.avif?t=1745889879\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/7f8e7141e60e3b7307d2ed85d32b24c7.avif?t=1745889879\" /></div>It is the year 2350, and what will later be known as the 2nd Aeon War is raging on Leng, a colonized moon 14 light years away from Earth. Three major fronts collide: the human-centric Nesuv Empire, the greedy technocrats from Drustan, and the corrupted aeons from the Arkosys organization. You're thrown into this web of lies, fractured alliances, and rising horror. Choose your side, shape your loyalties, and uncover the true enemy \u2014 before everything collapses.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/4eba4a0a42c7ea9ae9086c1970f8995c.poster.avif?t=1745889879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/4eba4a0a42c7ea9ae9086c1970f8995c.webm?t=1745889879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/4eba4a0a42c7ea9ae9086c1970f8995c.mp4?t=1745889879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Aeon Wars Tactics is a multiplayer turn-based strategy, tactical wargame. Featuring true digital miniatures, it is set in an original sci-fi universe where you battle with your friends in epic diorama-style terrains. Collect, build, and customize your army. Engage with your friends in large-scale battles and deadly skirmishes. Deploy powerful mechs, special units, and unique characters to save humanity or end its dominance on Leng. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/5edf763d4f9e49393e62fd77e389ee1b.avif?t=1745889879\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/5ffb6e8e7aaf1f36c8794ad9fae83fee.avif?t=1745889879\" /></div>Wargaming without real-world limits. Aeon Wars brings fully animated handcrafted miniatures, immersive maps with epic diorama-style terrains, and a frictionless hobby experience. Your miniatures have never looked so cool! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/19