class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/e2a9adc5c035a7a3889e813e5644c893.avif?t=1745889879\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/82ab324af477d4b52367daa448420fe6.webp?t=1745889879\" /></div>Decide which faction shall rule and impose its dominion on Leng. Each one has its radically unique flavor and gameplay style. Choose your favorite or try them all to experience the wide variety of models and abilities available.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/48ba0fb701fe07aa919c560c0b41282e.avif?t=1745889879\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939280/extras/7f8e7141e60e3b7307d2ed85d32b24c7.avif?t=1745889879\" /></div>It is the year 2350, and what will later be known as the 2nd Aeon War is raging on Leng, a colonized moon 14 light years away from Earth. Three major fronts collide: the human-centric Nesuv Empire, the greedy technocrats from Drustan, and the corrupted aeons from the Arkosys organization. You're thrown into this web of lies, fractured alliances, and rising horror. Choose your side, shape your loyalties, and uncover the true enemy \u2014 before everything collapses.</p>",
    "short_description": "Aeon Wars Tactics is a turn-based tactical wargame. Collect models and assemble them into armies. Play with friends in PvP or in PvE coop scenarios. Outside of play, enjoy your Collector Space and customize your models: swap parts and gear or paint new color schemes.",
